{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69/events","html_url":"https://github.com/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69","id":5831426039,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFHPU88AAAABW5R_9w","number":69,"title":"Review the executor's publish job before its logic moves to the CLI","user":{"login":"bentoluizv","id":53844142,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODQ0MTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53844142?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv","html_url":"https://github.com/bentoluizv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:43:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T19:25:11Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T19:25:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[{"issue_field_id":48149712,"node_id":"IFSSV_kgDOAMEqog","data_type":"single_select","issue_field_name":"Priority","value":84291385,"single_select_option":{"id":84291385,"name":"Medium","color":"yellow"}}],"type":{"id":897472419,"node_id":"IT_kwDOFEKeaM41flej","name":"Task","description":"A specific piece of work","color":"yellow","created_at":"2026-10-09T02:03:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:03:41Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":6,"completed":2,"percent_completed":33},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The executor's publish job (`dev-execute.yml`, job `dev-publish`) verifies the bundle, checks it against the plan, mints the executor App token, pushes the branch and opens the pull request. The accepted known gap #65, a plan comment the rounds job can post or edit, is the one the redesign closes.\n\nThis step is reviewed on its own before its logic moves to the Rust CLI that becomes the harness of every workflow. The principle the review applies: agents read, judge, write code and tests, search and propose criteria, one role per call; the CLI fetches the inputs, validates each agent output, enforces the rules and records the run. A finding becomes an enforced rule only when the owner accepts it.\n\nDone when a review posted on this issue states:\n- what the step does, under which identity and with which permissions (its row in `docs/stages.md`);\n- the input it trusts and where that input comes from;\n- what it may write;\n- the tests that pin it, and the behaviour no test pins;\n- the logic it runs today, in the prompt and in the shell, split into the judgement that stays with an agent and the deterministic work that moves to a CLI command, with the reason for each;\n- the issues it raises, filed as sub-issues of this one.\n","closed_by":{"login":"bentoluizv","id":53844142,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODQ0MTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53844142?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv","html_url":"https://github.com/bentoluizv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bentoluizv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/becloud-dev/workflows/issues/69/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}